Spawn tendrils of darkness to pursue a single target for up to 12 turns, leaving behind a trail of creeping darkness as they move. Targets seized by the tendrils are pinned for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns and shrouded in darkness. The darkness deals [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage per turn to those within.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower. You do [+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17% (TL1-5)] damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.
